OL,4,BTeenager Andreeva caps stunning week   
OL,5,Bwith WTA Finals title                  
OL,6,GFor Mirra Andreeva, the thought of her 
OL,7,Gfirst WTA Finals singles campaign was  
OL,8,Gso stressful that it gave her "a       
OL,9,Glittle breakdown" in a practice        
OL,10,Gsession before the tournament.         
OL,12,FThe 19-year-old may have been nervous  
OL,13,Fon arrival at Indian Wells, but she    
OL,14,Fleaves California as the champion,     
OL,15,Fhaving been the standout player of the 
OL,16,Fweek.                                  
OL,18,FThe French Open winner produced a hard-
OL,19,Ffought 7-5 6-3 victory over Elina      
OL,20,FSvitolina in Sunday's final to become  
OL,21,Fthe youngest champion of the event in  
OL,22,F22 years.                              
